 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty busy, but good.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Are store loyalty cards actually worth it, or is it just them tracking me?",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "block": "shopping.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Honestly, it's a bit of both. They do collect your shopping data, and in return you get points or member prices.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.98,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Member prices meaning what?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.4,
   "block": "shopping.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Some supermarkets now show two prices, and only card holders get the lower one. That can add up over a year.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hmm. I shop at the same place every week.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "block": "shopping.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then the card probably pays off for you. If the tracking bothers you, check the privacy settings, some let you opt out of marketing.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And the points thing?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "block": "shopping.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Points are usually worth very little each, but they build up slowly. Just don't buy things only to earn them.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg23"
  }
 ]
}
